          "id": "27415e30bb6cd9426d700ca3f1dee64eaff0ae8e",
          "message": "chore(deps): update wasmtime crates to v49.0.5 (#4601)\n\nThis PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Type | Update | Change |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| [wasmtime](https://redirect.github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime) |\nworkspace.dependencies | patch | `49.0.4` → `49.0.5` |\n| [wasmtime-wasi](https://redirect.github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime)\n| workspace.dependencies | patch | `49.0.4` → `49.0.5` |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>bytecodealliance/wasmtime (wasmtime)</summary>\n\n###\n[`v49.0.5`](https://redirect.github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/releases/tag/v49.0.5)\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/compare/v49.0.4...v49.0.5)\n\n#### 49.0.5\n\nReleased 2026-10-29.\n\n##### Fixed\n\n- wasi-sockets: UDP `connect` only required the address to be permitted\nfor\nsending *or* receiving, allowing guests to send datagrams to addresses\ndenied\n  for `UdpSend`.\n\n[GHSA-hmmr-87qq-258j](https://redirect.github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/security/advisories/GHSA-hmmr-87qq-258j)\n\n- Cross-engine type confusion with host-created\nstruct-types-with-supertypes\n  has been fixed.\n\n[GHSA-qw58-7h65-crq2](https://redirect.github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/security/advisories/GHSA-qw58-7h65-crq2)\n\n- Panic with typed functions with `i31` or `nullref` arguments has been\nfixed.\n\n[GHSA-3982-jqvv-277m](https://redirect.github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/security/advisories/GHSA-3982-jqvv-277m)\n\n- Unchecked memory usage in transferring borrowed resources between\ncomponents\n  has been fixed.\n\n[GHSA-6fr9-xmw9-5352](https://redirect.github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/security/advisories/GHSA-6fr9-xmw9-5352)\n\n- Fixed a possibility of content-length being invalid or not matching\nbody\n  length in wasi-http p2.\n\n[GHSA-h4wp-g4x3-7398](https://redirect.github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/security/advisories/GHSA-h4wp-g4x3-7398)\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Configuration\n\n📅 **Schedule**: (UTC)\n\n- Branch creation\n  - \"before 8am on Friday\"\n- Automerge\n  - At any time (no schedule defined)\n\n🚦 **Automerge**: Disabled by config. Please merge this manually once you\nare satisfied.\n\n♻ **Rebasing**: Whenever PR becomes conflicted, or you tick the\nrebase/retry checkbox.\n\n🔕 **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about these\nupdates again.\n\n---\n\n- [ ] <!-- rebase-check -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check\nthis box\n\n---\n\nThis PR was generated by [Mend Renovate](https://mend.io/renovate/).\nView the [repository job\nlog](https://developer.mend.io/github/open-telemetry/otel-arrow).\n\n<!--renovate-debug:eyJjcmVhdGVkSW5WZXIiOiI0NC4xODguMiIsInVwZGF0ZWRJblZlciI6IjQ0LjE4OC4yIiwidGFyZ2V0QnJhbmNoIjoibWFpbiIsImxhYmVscyI6WyJkZXBlbmRlbmNpZXMiXX0=-->\n\nCo-authored-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
